  unitName: Phantom Fissure Aaron
  unitId: 60705
  unitNumber: 924
  description: A demon who wandered about seeking shards containing the power he
    had lost. In order to remove the seal his older brother had placed on his powers,
    Aaron set off on a journey. After uncovering some of the crystals which held
    his imprisoned power, he began to grow stronger anew, though his desire to fight
    had somehow begun to fade away. As Aaron began to question the meaning of battle
    while he continued his efforts to remove the seal, it is said that his resentment
    against his older brother also began to fade away.
  summonDesc: A grave error helped me grow. Are you learning from your mistakes?
    Or are you just rotting away?
  fusionDesc: "My power is not growing\u2026 I'm simply regaining what I lost\u2026
    Don't think this in vain..."
  evoDesc: Compared to fighting, avoiding a fight is more difficult. Keep fighting
    until you learn that.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
